  `INSERT INTO counters (id, value)
   VALUES ($1, 1)
   ON CONFLICT (id)
   DO UPDATE SET value = counters.value + 1
   RETURNING value`,
  [req.params.id]
);

res.json({ value: result.rows[0].value });
```

Ensure `id` has a unique or primary-key constraint:

```sql
